<title>UK: Cricket-England drops Tufnell from Ashes squad.</title>
<headline>Cricket-England drops Tufnell from Ashes squad.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Left-arm spinner Phil Tufnell was released from the England squad on Tuesday ahead of the third test against Australia, starting at Old Trafford on Thursday,</p>
<p>England's management decided conditions would not be right to play Tufnell alongside off-spinner Robert Croft in rain-hit Manchester. He was not required for the first two tests either.</p>
<p>England lead the Ashes series 1-0.</p>
